  "text": "proprium.sancti-lucae-evangelistae-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Saint Luke the Evangelist” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that what we have received from Your holy altar may, by the prayers of Your blessed Evangelist, Luke, make our souls holy and thus keep us safe. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
